NOTE ON EXTERNAL DEPENDENCIES

This licence covers the RepoGen source code only. RepoGen orchestrates
third-party tools and datasets that carry their own licence terms, and it
does not redistribute any of them. Users are responsible for obtaining these
and for complying with their terms. In particular:

  MAGMA          Free for academic use; redistribution is not permitted.
                 Obtained via `repogen setup-resources`, which downloads it
                 from the authors' site to your machine.
                 https://cncr.nl/research/magma/

  ChEMBL         CC BY-SA 3.0.
  LINCS L1000    CC BY 4.0; registration required at clue.io.
  GTEx           Requires dbGaP authorisation for protected data.
  PDSP Ki        Academic use; manual download.
  eQTLGen        Terms accepted at download time.
  MetaBrain      Terms accepted at download time.
  MSigDB         Varies by collection; some are non-commercial only.

See docs/data_requirements.md for the full list and acquisition instructions.
